From 75f534d633d8c44da6493a12908fb2ddedf6b8e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johannes <johannes.hirche@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 16:25:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] texassemble: port cube-from-mips and -m from DirectXTex
 May 2026

Brings TexconvDLL/texassemble.cpp up to the command set of upstream
DirectXTex may2026 (Texassemble/texassemble.cpp oct2025..may2026):

- cube-from-mips: create a cubemap from provided mip images per face
- -m/--mip-levels for the *-from-mips commands, from-mips now validates
  the number of inputs against the mip chain (CalculateMipLevels)
- help and feedback commands, short usage without arguments

Errors go through RaiseError() like the rest of the file, ShellExecuteW
(feedback) is Windows only, other platforms print the URL.

Requires DirectXTex may2026 or newer (CalculateMipLevels).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
